      "message": "Does your implementation work with STM32H and STM32L series?\n\nfrom config-stm32f07x.h \n\n/* DFU Address */\n/* STM32F070xB, STM32F071xx, STM32F072xx use a common address of 0x1fffC800 */\n#define STM32_DFU_BASE              0x1fffC800",
